# DIGITALAND AI — Environment Variables
# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# Copy this file to `.env.local` and fill in your actual values.
#   ⚠️  .env.local  is in .gitignore — NEVER commit secrets to source control.
#   ⚠️  Do NOT use this file for Supabase Edge Function secrets.
#       Those are set via `supabase secrets set KEY=VALUE` (see below).
# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# ─── FRONTEND (Vite / Vercel) ────────────────────────────────────────────────
# These are bundled into the client-side JavaScript; they are public by nature.
# Never put secret keys here.

VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://fycqiwfbhqbltsthrpxk.supabase.co
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpc3MiOiJzdXBhYmFzZSIsInJlZiI6ImZ5Y3Fpd2ZiaHFibHRzdGhycHhrIiwicm9sZSI6ImFub24iLCJpYXQiOjE3Njk5MTUwMDcsImV4cCI6MjA4NTQ5MTAwN30.HecOV_tntiiL3n8I4x66nhyfjRC0iFW5qxpSU1U9BHM

VITE_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=YOUR_GOOGLE_OAUTH_CLIENT_ID.apps.googleusercontent.com
VITE_STRIPE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=pk_test_YOUR_STRIPE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY

# ─── BILLING MINIMUM ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Every request (including "free" models with $0 off_in/off_out) deducts at
# least this amount from the user's balance.  Prevents free-ride abuse.
# Set via:  supabase secrets set MINIMUM_CHARGE="0.001"
# Default:  0.001  ($0.001 per request)
MINIMUM_CHARGE=0.001

# ─── SUPABASE EDGE FUNCTION SECRETS ─────────────────────────────────────────
# These are ONLY stored on the server (Supabase Edge Functions Deno runtime).
# Set them with:  supabase secrets set KEY=VALUE
# Or in the Supabase Dashboard → Project Settings → Edge Functions → Secrets.
#
# ── Required ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#
# UPSTREAM_API_KEY
#   Your upstream provider API key (e.g. SiliconFlow, CrazyRouter, etc.).
#   Set via: supabase secrets set UPSTREAM_API_KEY="sk-or-..."
#
# OPENROUTER_API_KEY   (or: FALLBACK_API_KEY)
#   Your OpenRouter.com API key. Used as the fallback provider when the
#   primary upstream is unavailable.
#   Set via: supabase secrets set OPENROUTER_API_KEY="sk-or-..."
#
# ── Optional ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#
# UPSTREAM_API_URL
#   Primary upstream chat-completions endpoint.
#   Default: https://crazyrouter.com/v1/chat/completions
#   Set via: supabase secrets set UPSTREAM_API_URL="https://..."
#
# FALLBACK_API_URL
#   Fallback upstream chat-completions endpoint.
#   Default: https://openrouter.ai/api/v1/chat/completions
#
# UPSTREAM_MASTER_KEY
#   Alias for UPSTREAM_API_KEY (used in older deployments).
#
# SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY
#   The Supabase service role key for the edge function (set automatically
#   by the `withSupabase` wrapper when deployed via the Supabase CLI).
#
# GATEWAY_BILLING_EXEMPT_USER_ID
#   Set this to a user's UUID to bypass all billing for that account.
#   Must be kept secret — treat like a root password.
#   Default: not set (billing active for all users)
#
# ─── VERCEL ENVIRONMENT VARIABLES ─────────────────────────────────────────
# Set these in Vercel Dashboard → Project Settings → Environment Variables.
# They override or supplement the values above.
#
# UPSTREAM_API_KEY     → same as Supabase secret above
# OPENROUTER_API_KEY   → same as Supabase secret above
#
# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# QUICK START (after filling in .env.local)
# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
#
#   npm install        # install dependencies
#   npm run dev        # start dev server at http://localhost:5173
#
#   supabase secrets set UPSTREAM_API_KEY="sk-or-..."    # set gateway secrets
#   supabase functions deploy gateway                    # deploy the edge function
